CHCEK VERSION BEFORE DEPLOYING || MUST UPDATE VERSION BEFORE BUILD
UNCHECK LIB_ORIGIN GITIGNORE BEFORE DEPLOYING
MAYBE EXPO PREBUILD

RUN DEV CLIENT: npx expo start --dev-client --tunnel

BUILD APP FOR TESTING:   eas build -p ios --profile development
BUILD APP FOR SIMULATOR: eas build -p ios --profile simulator --local

BUILD APP FOR APP STORE: eas build

SUMBIT TO APP STORE: eas submit -p ios

npm run ts:check

